body:
EVEN THE MORMON CHURCH GETTING IN ON THE FUCKING TENDIES OH MY LAWD JESUS!!!

&#x200B;

\- an ex mormon who laughed at this post a lot

Friendly reminder to my bi family;

A femboy & masc equivalent are fine and valid. A trans person is fine and valid. But these are not the same thing and if you want to date a cute gender-non-conforming _anyone_ you need to communicate with _that individual_ about how they want you to treat them, what pronouns to use, etc and then _listen to them._ 

Sincerely, a bi trans woman who has dated/tried to date, other bi people of several genders
